# ==============================================================================
# MEGHAVYUHA — Environment Variables Example
# Smart India Hackathon 2026 | Problem Statement 26080
# Team: Against The Odds (Team ID: 149284)
# ==============================================================================
#
# MEGHAVYUHA runs fully KEY-FREE by default.
# All operational UI, replay scenarios, error diagnostics, and statistical
# validation charts operate autonomously without external API keys.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` to specify optional overrides.

# --- Optional Geospatial Overrides ---

# Swap the basemap style if default endpoints (Carto / OpenFreeMap) are firewalled.
# Any standard MapLibre / vector style JSON URL works.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASEMAP_STYLE=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/dark

# Optional Mapbox token (only required if using proprietary Mapbox vector tile styles)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_TOKEN=

# --- Optional API / Backend Endpoints ---

# Optional remote MEGHAVYUHA inference or data provider endpoint
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORECAST_API_URL=

# Identify MEGHAVYUHA to upstream public data archives (e.g. Zenodo, CDS)
# MEGHAVYUHA_USER_AGENT=MEGHAVYUHA/1.0 (+https://github.com/ParthKhansali/MeghaVyuha)
